---
// Why STAND — the founding belief, one statement on a green band (Nov 2026,
// January launch copy). Sits between the cream launch section and the
// mustard testimonials, so the page keeps alternating grounds: cream →
// green → mustard → pink → cream FAQ → red footer.
//
// Type follows the page's existing voices: Pie Pie for the headline (the FAQ
// headline's face), Editorial New Light for the statement (the About mega's
// magazine voice), Authentic Sans bold for the closing line.
// Chunks use the page-level data-rv reveal (armed by the index script).
---

<section class="fc-why" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2 id="why-title" data-rv style="--rvi: 0">Why STAND</h2>

    <p class="statement" data-rv style="--rvi: 1">
      Kids are capable of so much more than we give them credit for. They have
      big ideas and plenty to say. We wanted a place where they learn by doing:
      making things, making decisions, and figuring it out together. So we
      built one.
    </p>

    <p class="closer" data-rv style="--rvi: 2">
      Kids leave STAND knowing they can do hard things.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fc-why {
    background: var(--stand-green);
    color: var(--stand-cream);
  }

  .inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px);
    max-width: calc(1132px + 2 * 48px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(64px, 7vw, 112px) 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .statement {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 30ch;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .closer {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1.8vw, 26px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .inner {
      padding: var(--space-6) 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
